{
  "description": "Historical sound-change stepper — the learner applies ordered Great Vowel Shift rules one at a time and watches every word whose vowel matches strike all at once, rendering the before/after pronunciation on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
